*.spec.bak
third_party/

# Master question-bank workbooks for the DPP builder.
#
# NOT in version control, deliberately. "DPP and Infinite Practice Questions"
# is 53 MB of PW's own question content, and this repository is public — a
# push would publish the question bank itself. The app resolves these from an
# uploaded file, from QBG_TAGS_PATH / QUESTION_BANK_PATH, or from this folder,
# so a fresh clone still runs once the files are dropped in.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
!data/README.md

# A PyInstaller build made with --distpath while dist/UpscNotesApp is running (see scripts/package_release.py --build)
dist_staging/
